DESCRIPTION:The Cocalico Creek Watershed Association will be hosting their October meeting on Monday\, October 12th at 7:00pm. For more details about the event\, refer to CCWA’s Facebook page. You can also contact Dave Weidman (super45mom@yahoo.com) with questions about the meeting.
