SUMMARY:Chiques Creek Watershed Alliance Annual Membership Meeting
DESCRIPTION:A little review of the year past and initial planning for the year to come. And food!  All members are invited to attend. Notably\, we have revised the CCWA membership policy\, so that you can gain membership by paying the annual fee ($25\, payable by check or cash\, details here https://www.chiquescreekwatershedalliance.org/get-involved)\, or by participation or service to the organization in at least 4 events or 10 hours of service. There’s still time to get those service hours before the annual meeting – just reach out and see how!
URL:https://lancasterwatersheds.org/event/chiques-creek-watershed-alliance-annual-membership-meeting/
LOCATION:Kreider Cultural Center\, 547 N Penryn Road\, Manheim\, PA\, 17545\, United States
END:VEVENT
