SUMMARY:WQVC Meeting - October 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join volunteers of the Water Quality Volunteer Coalition for a meeting at the Farm & Home Center to discuss water quality sampling happening throughout the county. Interested/new and existing members are encouraged to attend! \nContact us for more details or for more information.
